[7715.220321, "o", "\t                frame->captures = NULL;\r\n   335\t                frame->capture_count = 0;\r\n   336\t                /* BUG: the callee's local base does not properly account for\r\n   337\t                   intermediate return values that earlier nested-call arguments\r\n   338\t                   left on the stack. For multi-argument calls that are preceded\r\n   339\t                   by such temporaries the base is mis-computed (off by one),\r\n   340\t                   so nested calls used as arguments (e.g. add(double(3), triple(2)))\r\n   341\t                   read the wrong stack slots and produce wrong results. */\r\n   342\t                frame->local_start = vm->sp - func->param_count;\r\n   343\t                vm->ip = func->addr;\r\n   344\t                break;\r\n   345\t            }\r\n   346\t            case BC_RET: {\r\n   347\t                Value retval = pop(vm);\r\n"]
